{"seq":3,"slug":"collab-exception-alert","title":"预测偏差/缺货风险预警","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/supplier-demand-forecast-collaboration/collab-dashboard-visibility/collab-exception-alert","wordCount":1777,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"预测偏差-缺货风险预警\">预测偏差/缺货风险预警</h1><p>看板是拉取式的：数据摆在那里，等人来看。但缺货是时间敏感的——等到采购员周一早上打开看板，能采取行动的时间窗已经过去了一半。预警要解决的就是这个：把「值得看」的信号在还来得及的时候主动推给双方。</p>\n<p>难点不在推送技术，而在<strong>阈值设计</strong>。阈值定太松，预警变成噪音，收件人很快学会忽略；定太紧，真问题被淹在大量假警报里。这一篇讲怎么把预警做成一个双方都愿意继续看的信号源。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-预警的三类信号\">核心概念：预警的三类信号</h2><p>值得主动推送的信号只有三类，其余都应该留在看板上等人来看。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>信号类型</th>\n<th>触发基础</th>\n<th>典型提前量</th>\n<th>行动方</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>覆盖不足</td>\n<td>覆盖天数低于阈值</td>\n<td>提前期量级（数周）</td>\n<td>双方</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>需求突变</td>\n<td>实际消耗显著偏离预测</td>\n<td>天到周</td>\n<td>平台为主</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>承诺缺口累积</td>\n<td>多轮承诺缺口叠加</td>\n<td>周</td>\n<td>双方</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"覆盖不足-用持续时长而非瞬时值触发\">覆盖不足：用持续时长而非瞬时值触发</h3><p>覆盖天数是一个高频波动的量，单日跌破阈值往往只是某天出库集中，不是真信号。正确做法是要求条件<strong>持续一段时间</strong>才触发——这正是 Prometheus 告警规则里 <code>for</code> 子句的语义：表达式为真之后还要在后续每次评估中保持为真，累计满 <code>for</code> 的时长才从 pending 转为 firing（<a href=\"https://prometheus.io/docs/prometheus/latest/configuration/alerting_rules/\">Prometheus Alerting Rules</a>）。同时可以用 <code>keep_firing_for</code> 让告警在条件消失后仍保持一小段时间，避免因数据缺口导致告警反复抖动。</p>\n<p>把这两个机制映射到供应链预警上：<code>for</code> 对应「连续 N 天覆盖不足」，<code>keep_firing_for</code> 对应「恢复后观察期」。缺了后者，一个料号会在阈值边界附近反复触发与解除，收件人看到的是刷屏而不是风险。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"# 缺货风险预警规则（结构与 Prometheus 告警规则同构）&#10;groups:&#10;  - name: stockout_risk&#10;    rules:&#10;      - alert: CoverBelowSafetyLine&#10;        expr: days_of_cover{supplier_part!=&quot;&quot;} &lt; 14&#10;        for: 3d # 连续 3 天低于 14 天才算真信号&#10;        keep_firing_for: 2d # 恢复后再观察 2 天，防抖动&#10;        labels:&#10;          severity: warning&#10;          owner: both&#10;        annotations:&#10;          summary: &#39;料号 {{ $labels.supplier_part }} 覆盖天数 {{ $value }} 天&#39;&#10;          runbook: &#39;确认在途状态 → 检查未确认建议 → 发起加急&#39;&#10;&#10;      - alert: CoverBelowHardLine&#10;        expr: days_of_cover &lt; 7&#10;        for: 1d # 硬线只给一天缓冲&#10;        labels:&#10;          severity: critical&#10;          owner: both&#10;        annotations:&#10;          summary: &#39;料号 {{ $labels.supplier_part }} 覆盖不足 7 天，可能断货&#39;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 缺货风险预警规则（结构与 Prometheus 告警规则同构）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">groups</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">stockout_risk</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    rules</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">alert</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">CoverBelowSafetyLine</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        expr</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">days_of_cover{supplier_part!=\"\"} &#x3C; 14</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">3d</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> # 连续 3 天低于 14 天才算真信号</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        keep_firing_for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">2d</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> # 恢复后再观察 2 天，防抖动</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        labels</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          severity</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">warning</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          owner</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">both</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        annotations</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          summary</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'料号 {{ $labels.supplier_part }} 覆盖天数 {{ $value }} 天'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          runbook</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'确认在途状态 → 检查未确认建议 → 发起加急'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">alert</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">CoverBelowHardLine</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        expr</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">days_of_cover &#x3C; 7</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">1d</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> # 硬线只给一天缓冲</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        labels</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          severity</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">critical</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          owner</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">both</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        annotations</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          summary</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'料号 {{ $labels.supplier_part }} 覆盖不足 7 天，可能断货'</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"需求突变-用偏差带而非固定百分比\">需求突变：用偏差带而非固定百分比</h3><p>需求突变的判定不能用「偏离预测 20%」这种固定值，因为不同料号的正常波动幅度差得很远。正确做法是用<a href=\"../forecast-supplier-decompose/forecast-confidence-share\">预测口径与置信度共享</a>里外发的分位数区间：实际累计消耗落在 P90 之上或 P10 之下，就是统计意义上的异常。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>异常</mtext><mtext>  </mtext><mo>⟺</mo><mtext>  </mtext><munder><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>W</mi></mrow></munder><msub><mi>y</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>&gt;</mo><msub><mi>Q</mi><mn>0.90</mn></msub><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>W</mi></mrow></munder><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>y</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>i</mi></msub><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mtext>或</mtext><mspace width=\"1em\"/><munder><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>W</mi></mrow></munder><msub><mi>y</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>&lt;</mo><msub><mi>Q</mi><mn>0.10</mn></msub><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>W</mi></mrow></munder><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>y</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>i</mi></msub><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{异常} \\iff \\sum_{i \\in W} y_i &gt; Q_{0.90}\\left(\\sum_{i \\in W} \\hat{y}_i\\right) \\quad \\text{或} \\quad \\sum_{i \\in W} y_i &lt; Q_{0.10}\\left(\\sum_{i \\in W} \\hat{y}_i\\right)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7073em;vertical-align:-0.024em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">异常</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">⟺</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3717em;vertical-align:-1.3217em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8557em;margi