ss=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size4\">)</span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">或</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8557em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">∈</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3217em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3.0717em;vertical-align:-1.3217em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0.10</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size4\">(</span></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8557em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">∈</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3217em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1944em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size4\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>用区间而不是固定百分比的好处是它自带校准：预测本身不准的料号，区间宽，不容易误报；预测很准的料号，区间窄，一次小偏差就能触发。这比给每个料号维护一个手调的百分比阈值要省力得多。</p>\n<h3 id=\"承诺缺口累积-把零散缺口加总起来看\">承诺缺口累积：把零散缺口加总起来看</h3><p>单次承诺折让通常不值得推送（<a href=\"../replenish-recommend-collab/supplier-commitment-feedback\">供应商承诺回传与差异</a>里的分类处置是异步的）。但连续多轮的缺口叠加起来就是风险。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 滚动 8 周内，某料号的累计承诺缺口超过安全库存覆盖量时预警&#10;CREATE VIEW commitment_gap_alert AS&#10;SELECT supplier_id, supplier_part,&#10;       sum(qty_gap)                                    AS cumulative_gap,&#10;       count(*) FILTER (WHERE qty_gap &gt; 0)             AS rounds_with_gap,&#10;       max(due_slip_days)                              AS worst_slip_days&#10;FROM commitment_variance&#10;WHERE created_at &gt;= now() - INTERVAL &#39;8 weeks&#39;&#10;GROUP BY supplier_id, supplier_part&#10;HAVING sum(qty_gap) &gt; (&#10;  SELECT coalesce(max(ss_qty), 0) FROM safety_stock_snapshot s&#10;  WHERE s.supplier_id = commitment_variance.supplier_id&#10;    AND s.supplier_part = commitment_variance.supplier_part&#10;);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 滚动 8 周内，某料号的累计承诺缺口超过安全库存覆盖量时预警</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> VIEW</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> commitment_gap_alert</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AS</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> supplier_id, supplier_part,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       sum</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(qty_gap)                                    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> cumulative_gap,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       count</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FILTER</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> qty_gap </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)             </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> rounds_with_gap,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       max</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(due_slip_days)                              </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> worst_slip_days</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> commitment_variance</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> created_at </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> INTERVAL </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'8 weeks'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">GROUP BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> supplier_id, supplier_part</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">HAVING</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> sum</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(qty_gap) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> coalesce</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">max</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(ss_qty), </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> safety_stock_snapshot s</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> s</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">supplier_id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> commitment_variance</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">supplier_id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    AND</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> s</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">supplier_part</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> commitment_variance</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">supplier_part</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这里的判据设计得刻意保守：只有累计缺口超过了安全库存本身的量才预警。理由是小缺口本来就是安全库存存在的意义，每次都报等于告诉对方「你的安全库存没用」。超过安全库存量意味着安全库存已被吃掉，这才是需要人介入的时刻。</p>\n<h2 id=\"预警的生命周期\">预警的生命周期</h2><p>一条预警从产生到关闭，中间的状态必须被追踪，否则「预警发过了」就变成了免责声明而不是风险管理。三类信号共用同一条生命周期，只是各自的关闭条件不同。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"stateDiagram-v2\" data-source=\"stateDiagram-v2&#10;  [*] --&gt; Inactive: 条件不成立&#10;  Inactive --&gt; Pending: 条件首次成立(进入 for 计时)&#10;  Pending --&gt; Inactive: for 未满即恢复&#10;  Pending --&gt; Firing: for 期满仍成立&#10;  Firing --&gt; Resolved: 条件消失(keep_firing 观察期后关闭)&#10;  Firing --&gt; Acknowledged: 责任人认领&#10;  Acknowledged --&gt; Resolved: 处置完成&#10;  Acknowledged --&gt; Escalated: 超过处置时限&#10;  Escalated --&gt; Resolved: 上级介入处置&#10;  Resolved --&gt; [*]\">stateDiagram-v2\n  [*] --&gt; Inactive: 条件不成立\n  Inactive --&gt; Pending: 条件首次成立(进入 for 计时)\n  Pending --&gt; Inactive: for 未满即恢复\n  Pending --&gt; Firing: for 期满仍成立\n  Firing --&gt; Resolved: 条件消失(keep_firing 观察期后关闭)\n  Firing --&gt; Acknowledged: 责任人认领\n  Acknowledged --&gt; Resolved: 处置完成\n  Acknowledged --&gt; Escalated: 超过处置时限\n  Escalated --&gt; Resolved: 上级介入处置\n  Resolved --&gt; [*]</pre><p><code>Pending</code> 与 <code>Inactive</code> 分离的价值在于可观测性：如果一个料号长期停留在 Pending 而从不 Firing，说明它的波动正好卡在阈值附近，阈值可能设得过紧。这个分布本身就是调参的依据，比等收件人抱怨「太吵」要早得多。</p>\n<p><code>Escalated</code> 则解决了另一个常见问题：预警被认领之后就石沉大海。超过处置时限自动升级，把「有人看到了」和「有人在处理」区分开。</p>\n<h2 id=\"推送路由与降噪\">推送路由与降噪</h2><p>信号识别出来之后，还有一个同样重要的问题：推给谁、推几次。</p>\n<h3 id=\"路由规则\">路由规则</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>信号</th>\n<th>平台侧收件人</th>\n<th>供应商侧收件人</th>\n<th>渠道</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>覆盖不足（warning）</td>\n<td>采购负责人</td>\n<td>供应商跟单员</td>\n<td>门户待办 + 日报汇总</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>覆盖不足（critical）</td>\n<td>采购负责人 + 品类经理</td>\n<td>供应商跟单员 + 生产计划</td>\n<td>即时消息 + 门户待办</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>需求突变</td>\n<td>需求计划员</td>\n<td>由平台决定是否共享</td>\n<td>门户待办</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>承诺缺口累积</td>\n<td>采购负责人</td>\n<td>供应商销售对接人</td>\n<td>门户待办 + 周报</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>关键设计是<strong>平台侧与供应商侧的收件人不同</strong>：平台侧关注需求侧影响（要不要调需求、要不要找备选），供应商侧关注执行侧影响（要不要加班、要不要改排产）。同一个信号推给两边，但落在不同人的待办里，附带的信息也应当不同——给供应商的版本可以包含具体的建议动作，给平台的版本则应包含缺口影响评估。</p>\n<h3 id=\"降噪的三种手段\">降噪的三种手段</h3><p><strong>聚合</strong>。同一次批量计算产生的多条预警合并成一条摘要，而不是发 N 条。一个供应商如果 40 个料号同时跌破覆盖线，收到的应该是一条「40 个料号覆盖不足，最严重的 5 个是……」而不是 40 条消息。</p>\n<p><strong>抑制</strong>。当上游信号已经发了（如需求突变），下游由它引起的信号（覆盖不足）在一段时间内不再单独发，只在摘要里标注「由需求突变引起」。</p>\n<p><strong>摘要周期</strong>。warning 级信号进入日报，不进即时消息；只有 critical 进即时消息。这条规则本身要写进配置，而不是靠人自觉。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;alertRouting&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;supplierId&quot;: &quot;SUP-1042&quot;,&#10;    &quot;channels&quot;: {&#10;      &quot;portal_todo&quot;: { &quot;enabled&quot;: true, &quot;minSeverity&quot;: &quot;warning&quot; },&#10;      &quot;im_direct&quot;: { &quot;enabled&quot;: true, &quot;minSeverity&quot;: &quot;critical&quot; },&#10;      &quot;daily_digest&quot;: { &quot;enabled&quot;: true, &quot;cron&quot;: &quot;0 7 * * *&quot;, &quot;groupBy&quot;: &quot;supplier_part_category&quot; }&#10;    },&#10;    &quot;dedupe&quot;: { &quot;windowMinutes&quot;: 30, &quot;key&quot;: &quot;supplier_part+alertType&quot; },&#10;    &quot;suppressIfParentFired&quot;: [&quot;cover_below_line&quot;, &quot;commit_gap_alert&quot;]&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"alertRouting\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"supplierId\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"SUP-1042\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"channels\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"portal_todo\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"enabled\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"minSeverity\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"warning\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"im_direct\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"enabled\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"minSeverity\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"critical\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"daily_digest\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"enabled\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"cron\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"0 7 * * *\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"groupBy\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"supplier_part_category\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"dedupe\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"windowMinutes\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">30</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"key\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"supplier_part+alertType\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"suppressIfParentFired\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"cover_below_line\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"commit_gap_alert\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[每日计算&lt;br/&gt;覆盖天数/消耗/承诺缺口] --&gt; B{信号类型}&#10;  B --&gt; C[覆盖不足&lt;br/&gt;for=3d / keep_firing=2d]&#10;  B --&gt; D[需求突变&lt;br/&gt;落在 P10-P90 之外]&#10;  B --&gt; E[承诺缺口累积&lt;br/&gt;超过安全库存量]&#10;  C --&gt; F[严重度分级]&#10;  D --&gt; F&#10;  E --&gt; F&#10;  F --&gt;|warning| G[日报摘要&lt;br/&gt;按品类聚合]&#10;  F --&gt;|critical| H[即时消息 + 门户待办]&#10;  G --&gt; I[去重窗口 30 min]&#10;  H --&gt; I&#10;  I --&gt; J{上游信号已发?}&#10;  J --&gt;|是| K[抑制,仅在摘要中标注]&#10;  J --&gt;|否| L[分发: 平台侧 / 供应商侧 各自收件人]\">graph TD\n  A[每日计算&lt;br/&gt;覆盖天数/消耗/承诺缺口] --&gt; B{信号类型}\n  B --&gt; C[覆盖不足&lt;br/&gt;for=3d / keep_firing=2d]\n  B --&gt; D[需求突变&lt;br/&gt;落在 P10-P90 之外]\n  B --&gt; E[承诺缺口累积&lt;br/&gt;超过安全库存量]\n  C --&gt; F[严重度分级]\n  D --&gt; F\n  E --&gt; F\n  F --&gt;|warning| G[日报摘要&lt;br/&gt;按品类聚合]\n  F --&gt;|critical| H[即时消息 + 门户待办]\n  G --&gt; I[去重窗口 30 min]\n  H --&gt; I\n  I --&gt; J{上游信号已发?}\n  J --&gt;|是| K[抑制,仅在摘要中标注]\n  J --&gt;|否| L[分发: 平台侧 / 供应商侧 各自收件人]</pre><h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>预警的价值在于时间提前量，但阈值设计决定了它会不会被忽略；三类信号（覆盖不足、需求突变、承诺缺口累积）覆盖了绝大多数值得推送的场景。</li>\n<li>覆盖不足必须要求条件持续一段时间才触发（对应 Prometheus 的 <code>for</code>），并用恢复观察期（<code>keep_firing_for</code>）防止在阈值附近抖动。</li>\n<li>需求突变应该用外发的分位数区间判定，而不是固定百分比——分位数自带按料号校准的能力。</li>\n<li>承诺缺口累积的判据要保守（超过安全库存量才报），否则每次缺口都报等于宣告安全库存无效。</li>\n<li>降噪靠聚合、抑制与摘要周期三种手段，路由要把平台侧与供应商侧的收件人区分开。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>延伸：预警依赖的覆盖天数口径见<a href=\"shared-inventory-visibility\">联合库存与在途可见</a>；预警触发的响应是否有效，最终要由<a href=\"../collab-performance/stockout-overstock-improve\">缺货率/库存周转改善</a>来验证。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"预测偏差/缺货风险预警","id":"预测偏差-缺货风险预警"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：预警的三类信号","id":"核心概念-预警的三类信号"},{"level":3,"text":"覆盖不足：用持续时长而非瞬时值触发","id":"覆盖不足-用持续时长而非瞬时值触发"},{"level":3,"text":"需求突变：用偏差带而非固定百分比","id":"需求突变-用偏差带而非固定百分比"},{"level":3,"text":"承诺缺口累积：把零散缺口加总起来看","id":"承诺缺口累积-把零散缺口加总起来看"},{"level":2,"text":"预警的生命周期","id":"预警的生命周期"},{"level":2,"text":"推送路由与降噪","id":"推送路由与降噪"},{"level":3,"text":"路由规则","id":"路由规则"},{"level":3,"text":"降噪的三种手段","id":"降噪的三种手段"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"联合库存与在途可见","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/supplier-demand-forecast-collaboration/collab-dashboard-visibility/shared-inventory-visibility"},"next":{"title":"共享预测准确率度量","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/supplier-demand-forecast-collaboration/collab-performance/forecast-accuracy-shared"}}